{
  "id": "pl-wyrozniki-2",
  "description": "Polish two-letter plate prefixes: voivodeship letter (Załącznik nr 13, col. 4) + one-letter powiat discriminant (col. 5), for tablice zwyczajne, zabytkowe and — via the same annex — the powiat-level series. Built as the per-voivodeship cross product of the voivodeship letters with the one-letter powiat codes, as prescribed by § 31 ust. 2-3 (the second voivodeship letter serves the same powiats after the first is exhausted). Includes the codes added by Dz.U. 2025 poz. 939 (in force 2025-07-30); the pairs added by Dz.U. 2026 poz. 891 § 1 pkt 9 are two-letter powiat codes and live in pl-wyrozniki-3. Per-code first-issuance dates are not tracked (format legality, not issuance).",
